          "text": "Description: On July 29, 1987, at approximately 6:45 a.m., two witnesses in a car observed a large, bright white mass moving quickly above the communal forest. This mass had the color of polished metal and was roughly 20 meters long. During the few seconds of observation, no noise or odor was noticed. The mass disappeared below the horizon. No explanation could be provided.",
